    "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview",
    "generated": "2026-09-11",
    "profile_character": "Main Squeeze is dominated by a robust blend of spicy β-caryophyllene and bright, citrusy limonene, perfectly capturing its Ponderosa lemon and Lemon Cherry Gelato heritage. This pairing is grounded by a significant presence of earthy selinadienes and myrcene, creating a complex aroma that balances sharp, zesty fruit with deep botanical warmth.",
