        "mg_per_serving": 3.46,
        "researched_for": "Researchers are fascinated by β-caryophyllene because it directly binds to the body's cannabinoid receptors, and it is being studied for its potential to support healthy inflammatory responses, neuroprotection, and a balanced mood (Oxford level 1b, human trials)."
      },
      {
        "name": "Limonene",
        "share_percent": 10.11,
